{
  "sn22.63:0.1": "Linked Discourses 22.63 ",
  "sn22.63:0.2": "7. The Perfected Ones ",
  "sn22.63:0.3": "When You Grasp ",
  "sn22.63:1.1": "So I have heard. ",
  "sn22.63:1.2": "At one time the Buddha was staying near Sāvatthī in Jeta’s Grove, Anāthapiṇḍika’s monastery. ",
  "sn22.63:1.3": "Then a mendicant went up to the Buddha, bowed, sat down to one side, and said to him, ",
  "sn22.63:1.4": "“Sir, may the Buddha please teach me Dhamma in brief. When I’ve heard it, I’ll live alone, withdrawn, diligent, keen, and resolute.” ",
  "sn22.63:1.5": "“When you grasp, mendicant, you’re bound by Māra. ",
  "sn22.63:1.6": "Not grasping, you’re free from the Wicked One.” ",
  "sn22.63:1.7": "“Understood, Blessed One! Understood, Holy One!” ",
  "sn22.63:2.1": "“But how do you see the detailed meaning of my brief statement?” ",
  "sn22.63:2.2": "“Sir, when you grasp form you’re bound by Māra. ",
  "sn22.63:2.3": "Not grasping, you’re free from the Wicked One. ",
  "sn22.63:2.4": "When you grasp feeling … ",
  "sn22.63:2.5": "",
  "sn22.63:2.6": "perception … ",
  "sn22.63:2.7": "choices … ",
  "sn22.63:2.8": "consciousness, you’re bound by Māra. ",
  "sn22.63:2.9": "Not grasping, you’re free from the Wicked One. ",
  "sn22.63:2.10": "That’s how I understand the detailed meaning of the Buddha’s brief statement.” ",
  "sn22.63:3.1": "“Good, good, mendicant! ",
  "sn22.63:3.2": "It’s good that you understand the detailed meaning of what I’ve said in brie